    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i8pjg0t",
      "content": "The Kerala Legislative Assembly is the unicameral legislature of Kerala. It has 140 elected members. The assembly meets at the Niyamasabha Mandapam in Thiruvananthapuram."
    },
